WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.580
A customer lands on your site. It takes six seconds to load. They're already gone — and you paid for that click.

00:06.580 --> 00:14.371
I build the whole product, front to back: the design, the frontend, the backend, the database, and the deploy. One engineer, one coherent build.

00:14.371 --> 00:24.206
The hard part is production quality. Fast, accessible, secure, and search-friendly — not just pretty in a screenshot. I build for real users on real devices.

00:24.206 --> 00:32.415
Then I prove it: Lighthouse scores, load times, accessibility, and tests — gated in your pipeline, so a good site stays good.

00:32.415 --> 00:36.483
Sites and apps that ship — and perform. Let's build yours.

